{
  "id": "i01-l05",
  "unit": "i01-catching-up",
  "title": "What were you doing?",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "**Was doing**: take the present-continuous form and swap its ending for a **ছিল** ending.\n\n- করছি → **করছিলাম** 'I was doing'\n- তুমি **করছিলে** · সে **করছিল** · আপনি **করছিলেন**\n- যাচ্ছি → **যাচ্ছিলাম**, খাচ্ছি → **খাচ্ছিলাম**, পড়ছি → **পড়ছিলাম**\n\nIt describes one moment in the past, not a habit: **আমি তখন ঘুমাচ্ছিলাম** 'I was sleeping then' vs **আমি রাতে বই পড়তাম** 'I used to read at night'.\n\nWeather: **বৃষ্টি হচ্ছিল** 'it was raining'.\n\nNegative with **না**: **ঘুমাচ্ছিলাম না** 'I wasn't sleeping'.\n\nOther spellings: করছিলো, হচ্ছিলো. Kolkata: ঘুমোচ্ছিলাম.",
  "vocab": [
