          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "হ্যাঁ, খুব ক্লান্ত ছিলাম। তুমি কী করছিলে?",
          "tr": "hya~, khub klanto chhilam. tumi ki korchhile?",
          "en": "Yes, I was very tired. What were you doing?"
